{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, move to it, pick it up, move it, do specified task, else scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObjLocation    /> <Action ID = RandomMovement    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDesignatedSpot    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <SubTree ID = SpecialTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
